<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON FOURTH DAY ORDER OF PLAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON FOURTH DAY ORDER OF PLAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Order of play for matches on the</p>
<p>top courts on Thursday, the fourth day of Wimbledon (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Centre court (starts 1100GMT)</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Olga Barabanschkova (Belarus)</p>
<p>14-Tim Henman (Britain) v Jerome Golmard (France)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany)</p>
<p>14-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) v Amy Frazier (U.S.)</p>
<p>Number One Court (starts 1100GMT)</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) v Jonathan Stark (U.S.)</p>
<p>Anna Kournikova (Russia) v Barbara Rittner (Germany)</p>
<p>8-Boris Becker (Germany) v Thomas Johansson (Sweden)</p>
<p>16-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) v Marc Rosset (Switzerland)</p>
<p>Number Two Court (starts 1000GMT)</p>
<p>Venus Williams (U.S.) v Magdalena Grzybowska (Poland)</p>
<p>9-Mary Pierce (U.S.) v Dominique van Roost (Belgium)</p>
<p>2-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) v Magnus Norman (Sweden)</p>
<p>7-Anke Huber (Germany) v Joanetta Kruger (South Africa)</p>
<p>Number Three Court (starts 1000GMT)</p>
<p>Samantha Smith (Britain) v Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan)</p>
<p>Larisa Neiland (Latvia) v Naoko Kijimuta (Japan)</p>
<p>4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) v Andri Pavel (Romania)</p>
<p>10-Conchita Martinez (Spain) v Yuka Yoshida (Japan)</p>
</text>
